  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The magical power in your veins grows in strength.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Improved Eldritch Heritage<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You add gain a bonus feat from your list of bloodline feats, or you gain the mythic version of a bloodline feat you already possess. In addition, you treat your character level as your sorcerer level for any 3rd or 9th-level bloodline powers you gain from the Improved Eldritch Heritage feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-g-m-feats#toc39\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
